---
const { provider } = Astro.props;
---

<article class="provider-card">
  <div class="provider-card-top">
    <div>
      <p class="card-kicker">服务商资料卡</p>
      <h2><a href={`/providers/${provider.slug}/`}>{provider.name}</a></h2>
    </div>
    <span class="status-pill">暂无实测</span>
  </div>
  <p>本页整理服务商名称与注册入口；套餐、价格、条款和服务表现尚未由本站独立核验。</p>
  <a class="text-link" href={`/providers/${provider.slug}/`}>查看资料卡 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  <a class="button button-primary provider-register" href={provider.registerLinks[0].url} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">{provider.registerLinks[0].label} ↗</a>
</article>
